<title>POLAND: Polish NBP buys dollars - dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP buys dollars - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) bought large amounts of dollars on the interbank market, dealers said.</p>
<p>However, they could not immediatley give the level at which the deals were done.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
